        "title": "One of the oldest and marvellous hindu shrines!",
        "text": "The temple is an ancient place of worship. It has powerful enegies. One can witness special pujas here. Its very crowded and at times not very clean but if one can lift oneself away from the mundane then one can experience the real power of devotion. Its a Lord Shiva temple and one of the most important shaivite shrine. After visiting the temple one cay buy good quality rudraksh beads outside. Only Hindus are allowed inside the main temple which can be a bit troublesome for the western tourists. My western friend had to stay outside when I went inside to do the puja.\n",
